# Girls' names are personal data about minors. Nothing that contains a roster
# belongs in version control — not the enrollment exports, not the form
# snapshots (Jotform stores each club's roster as checkbox options), and not
# the auto-sync runner's working files (data/auto_sync/).
data/
backups/
*.csv
# The CSVs that belong in git: the synthetic test fixture (fictional names,
# generated by test/fixtures/make_fixture.py), the work log behind the
# monthly invoice (dates, hours and descriptions only — no names; scanned by
# `make secrets` like every tracked file) and the time zones the Mac was on,
# which the work log's days are counted in.
!test/fixtures/enrollment_sample.csv
!worklog/worklog.csv
!worklog/timezones.csv

# Never commit credentials. The Jotform API key belongs in .env / the
# environment (JOTFORM_API_KEY) and, for the Sheet scripts, in Script
# Properties. The Google service-account key lives in credentials/.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.key
secrets*
credentials/*
!credentials/README.md
!credentials/config.example.json
service-account*.json

# Claude Code per-machine files. settings.local.json must never hold secrets
# (it did once — see docs/DECISIONS.md); the live-gate log records which
# live-system commands the hook allowed or blocked on this machine.
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/*.local.json
.claude/live_gate.log
.claude/worktrees/

# Per-checkout Python environment: python3 -m venv .venv && .venv/bin/pip install -r requirements-dev.txt
.venv/
venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.DS_Store
node_modules/

# clasp login token lives in ~/.clasprc.json (never in the repo); the
# project link (.clasp.json) is not secret but is per-installation
appsscript/.clasp.json
